iety Ouroboros. Amid rising political turmoil and calls for Crossbell's independence, the SSS finds itself standing between the city and forces determined to reshape its fate.", "summary": "The Legend of Heroes: Trails to Azure is the fifth installment in the main Trails series, serving as a direct sequel to the events of the The Legend of Heroes: Trails from Zero and the ending to the Crossbell arc. The game follows the Special Support Section with more members and more cases to solve.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-legend-of-heroes-trails-to-azure", "videos": [{"id": 9640, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "CuPw-84z16o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CuPw-84z16o", "title": "\u300c\u82f1\u96c4\u4f1d\u8aac \u78a7\u306e\u8ecc\u8de1\u300d\uff2f\uff30\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc(\u30ca\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3042\u308a)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CuPw-84z16o/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 9639, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "qJz7K0ZtSUI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJz7K0ZtSUI", "title": "\u300c\u82f1\u96c4\u4f1d\u8aac\u3000\u78a7\u306e\u8ecc\u8de1\u300d\u4e88\u544a\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qJz7K0ZtSUI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 9641, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "AOK_B4BtT40", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AOK_B4BtT40", "title": "\u300c\u82f1\u96c4\u4f1d\u8aac \u78a7\u306e\u8ecc\u8de1\u300d\u30c7\u30e2\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AOK_B4BtT40/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 182943, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "8dssaQuEAiY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8dssaQuEAiY", "title": "The Legend of Heroes: Trails to Azure - Announcement Trailer (Nintendo Switch 2, PS5)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8dssaQuEAiY/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 187467, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "XHpTVUikuO0